Map backgrounds
  No map picture is included. map-background.example.json points at joric's
  Subnautica 2 tileset (https://github.com/joric/subnautica2_tileset, Unlicense),
  a community capture of the game loaded from joric's site by the viewer's browser.
  That licence covers joric's work and can't speak for the game's own rights.

